          <article><span>04</span><h2>Statements & records</h2><p>Access financial history, transaction details and downloadable records when you need them.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="nb-public-dark">
        <span class="nb-kicker">ONE CONNECTED EXPERIENCE</span>
        <h2>See your money clearly. Take action confidently.</h2>
        <p>NovBank is designed to keep balances, activity, money movement and account controls connected rather than scattering everyday banking across disconnected experiences.</p>
